 "In 1928,", "a scientist", "came back from holiday", "to a pile", "of dirty dishes.",
 "One of them", "was about to", "change the world.",
 "A fuzzy mould", "had landed on it.",
 "And all around", "the mould,", "the bacteria", "were dead.",
 "Here's why.",
 "A bacterium lives", "inside a wall", "it keeps rebuilding", "as it grows.",
 "The mould's chemical", "jams the builders.",
 "The wall cracks,", "and the bacterium", "bursts.",
 "Fleming called it", "penicillin.",
 "But he could barely", "make any,", "and for ten years,", "almost nobody", "paid attention.",
 "Then, in Oxford,", "a team finally", "purified it.",
 "Their first", "real test", "was a dying policeman.",
